| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Title (1:2) | MOUSE_ENTER 0.2s | OVERLAY at 0,400 | Home (1:10) | MOVE_IN | BOTTOM | spring(mass 1, stiffness 300, damping 20, velocity 0) | 800ms |
| Title (1:2) | MOUSE_LEAVE | CLOSE | — | INSTANT | — | — | — |
| Title (1:2) | ON_PRESS | URL (new tab) | https://example.com/help | INSTANT | — | — | — |
| Button (1:3) | ON_CLICK | NAVIGATE | Home (1:10) | PUSH | LEFT | cubic-bezier(0.2, 0, 0, 1) | 300ms |
| Button (1:3) | ON_KEY_DOWN KEYBOARD 13 | NAVIGATE | Home (1:10) | INSTANT | — | — | — |
| Button (1:3) | ON_HOVER | SCROLL_TO | Title (1:2) | SMART_ANIMATE | — | GENTLE | 600ms |

